---
description: How to run the Kiyos prototype locally
alwaysApply: true
---
- Cursor in this project is for reading code and live preview. Claude Code is the primary coding agent; don't make code changes here unless the user asks in this chat.
- Never start, stop or restart dev servers: no `pnpm dev`, `next dev`, `uvicorn`, `make up` or `make down`. The user runs `make up` in their own terminal. Two web servers in this folder share `web/.next` and corrupt each other's build (500 errors, MODULE_NOT_FOUND), and two APIs on :8000 answer different requests.
- Preview http://localhost:3000 (web) and http://localhost:8000/health (API). If one doesn't respond, tell the user. Don't restart it.
- Don't run git commands that change state (commit, push, reset, checkout, stash) without the user's approval.
- Logs: `data/logs/web.log` and `data/logs/api.log`.
